## Why This Is Asked

This scenario tests knowledge of vector DB usage, chunking strategy, latency, and graceful fallback in a realistic but beginner-friendly context.

## Key Concepts

- Retrieval-augmented generation
- Document chunking
- Embedding models
- Vector DB indexing and search
- Latency targets and freshness
- Fallback mechanisms

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple chunker
function chunkText(text, maxChars) {
  const chunks = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i += maxChars) {
    chunks.push(text.slice(i, i + maxChars));
  }
  return chunks;
}
```

